# Share feed (sandbox).
ipc sharingdemo peers
wait 1
# MANUAL: open the share sheet (ShareSheet plan) and hover device 4 (needs a pointer on a layer surface)
ptr move 1100 540 sleep 300 glide 1100 540 50
ipc sharingdemo sending 30
ipc sharingdemo sending 50
ipc sharingdemo sending 20
ipc sharingdemo sending 70
ipc sharingdemo sending 40
wait 1
shot feed-sending
note Only device 1's status and ring change with each update; the hovered device (4) keeps its hover fill throughout (same as QML). NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness.
# MANUAL: Click "Copy" on a file share: wl-paste -l lists text/uri-list and the sheet closes
ipc sharingdemo ask
wait 1
shot feed-ask
note The incoming card is shown; click Accept (about (1027,645)) and the card should go to receiving (the answer reached the shell).
ptr move 1027 645 click
wait 1
shot feed-accepted
note The card shows "receiving" (progress) after Accept, as in QML. NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness.
